What the EUPL does not cover
----------------------------

The EUPL covers Fenmyr's code. It does not cover the following, which remain
all rights reserved by Stephen Chiang, and the files named here are not
licensed under the EUPL. See TRADEMARKS.md.

- The name "Fenmyr" for this app, and the Fenmyr logo and app icon:
  assets/icon.png, web/favicon.png, tools/make-icon.ts, and the fenmyr-mark
  icon in tools/icons/custom.ts.
- The name "Myra" for the assistant, and Myra the cloudberry character in any
  form: the code that draws her (src/web/goo.ts, src/web/gooBusy.ts,
  src/web/gooPixels.ts, src/web/gooPoses.ts, src/web/gooShapes.ts), her
  stickers (web/stamps/myra-*) and any art of her.
- Fenmyr's and Myra's own art and illustrations: the stamp set (web/stamps/),
  the README cover (assets/readme-cover.jpg), and the scripts that draw the
  stickers, stamps, app icon and mark (assets/art/make_art.py,
  assets/art/make_mark.py).
- Their own icons: the cloudberry mark, the Myra tool and the chat icon
  (tools/icons/custom.ts), and the cloudberry glyph font
  (web/fonts/MyraMark.woff2).

